'| 3 OpenSearch / Dashboards | PASS | Unauthenticated 401; authenticated 200, three nodes green. Dashboards 302 login and saved-objects import/export of 10 objects: three index patterns, six data-backed panels, SOC overview. Export: `soc/opensearch/dashboards/soc-overview.ndjson`. |',
