f'| 5 Threat intel | PASS | MISP HTTP 200, authenticated event `{intel["misp_event"]["uuid"]}` with {intel["misp_event"]["attributes"]} attributes; ConfigMap with four indicators; explicit Zeek reload; fresh Kafka proof after latest-offset snapshot; {intel["fresh_zeek_hits"]["count"]} fresh tap domain hits and {intel["fresh_opensearch_hits"]} fresh indexed domain hits; ACTIVE alert `{intel["alert_ids"][0]}`. See `intel-hop-proof.json` and `intel-kafka-proof.txt`. |',
